ArcticDownloader 0.2.6 update log

Purpose:
- Track the cross-platform changes included in the 0.2.6 release.

Entries:
- 2026-08-05
  - Added binary NixOS release packaging and documented profile and declarative installation.
  - Consolidated the Linux and Windows application into one repository with platform-specific backends and frontends.
  - Added multi-GPU selection and filtered Torch profiles by the selected GPU backend and operating system.
  - Improved mixed-GPU Linux detection, including headless NVIDIA 3D controllers.
  - Updated Linux AMD profiles for ROCm 7.2 while keeping Windows ROCm SDK and Intel XPU profiles platform-specific.
  - Fixed Windows ComfyUI Manager process output handling and verified Manager startup in the Windows VM.
  - Moved ComfyUI Git update checks off the UI thread to prevent startup freezes.
  - Increased the iterative Civitai HTML scan budget and corrected its diagnostic message.
  - Updated public Nix profile instructions to use `nix profile add`.
